---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Slide Types">
  <div class="docs-content">
    <h1>Slide Types</h1>

    <h2>Creating a New Slide</h2>
    <p>When adding a new slide, choose from four types:</p>

    <hr />

    <h3>1. Image Only Slide</h3>
    <p>Perfect for showcasing products or promotions with simple visual impact.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Upload three image versions for responsive display</li>
      <li>Add slide title</li>
      <li>Set destination link</li>
      <li>Add an Alt text for the images</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-tip">
      <p><strong>Best Practice:</strong> Optimize your images for different screen sizes to ensure fast loading times across all devices.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <h3>2. Image and Text Slide</h3>
    <p>Combine visual appeal with compelling copy for maximum engagement.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Upload an image
        <ul>
          <li>Add an Alt text for the images</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        Add customizable text elements:
        <ul>
          <li>Title text</li>
          <li>Description text</li>
          <li>Call-to-action button text</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        Customize styling:
        <ul>
          <li>Text colors</li>
          <li>Background colors</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <hr />

    <h3>3. Video Slide</h3>
    <p>Engage visitors with dynamic video content.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Two video source options:
        <ul>
          <li>External link (YouTube, Vimeo, etc.)</li>
          <li>Direct video upload</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        Display options:
        <ul>
          <li>Show/hide pause and play buttons</li>
          <li>Control settings configuration</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-note">
      <p><strong>Note:</strong> For best performance, keep video files under 10MB and use external links when possible.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <h3>4. Product Slide</h3>
    <p>Directly feature products from your Shopify store.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Search by product title</li>
      <li>
        Automatically pulls:
        <ul>
          <li>Product main image</li>
          <li>Product title</li>
          <li>Product link</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        Customization options:
        <ul>
          <li>Override product title</li>
          <li>Add secondary text</li>
          <li>Show/hide product price</li>
          <li>Define background</li>
          <li>Control out-of-stock display</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-tip">
      <p><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Product slides automatically update when you change product information in your Shopify store.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <div class="mt-12 flex gap-4">
      <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/creating-banners`} class="btn bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-300">
        ← Previous: Creating Banners
      </a>
      <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/settings`} class="btn btn-primary">
        Next: Banner Settings →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
